sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability of the station to inoperative

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Inoperative)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: operationalStatus must be Inoperative,<br>evseId must be omitted,<br>connectorId must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Scheduled)

    loop For all unoccupied connectors
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Unavailable)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Wait for <Configured Transaction Duration>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State StopAuthorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPostSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected

    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (configured connector, connectorStatus = Unavailable)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: A respond to report the state of a connector<br>has been received for all connectors
